abstract: >
  Open reference framework for leakage-aware longitudinal EHR binary risk
  prediction (chronic-disease and other horizon tasks) with isotonic calibration,
  SHAP explanations, FastAPI and Angular serving, and reproducible evaluation
  artifacts for research prototyping.
keywords:
  - electronic health records
  - chronic disease
  - calibration
  - explainable AI
  - temporal leakage
